{
  "id": "E363",
  "title": "Black is Cooler",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-09-28",
  "synopsis": "Ben is buying a new scooter. Why did he pick a black one?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1162/3de0f1a4fa20cc3b6f67d8970ab34699837a0c66.mp3?1569234903",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "黑色比较帅\n\n本：我要买这种电动车，什么颜色的比较好？\n售货员：黑的怎么样？\n本：我不太喜欢黑色。蓝色的有吗？\n售货员：有蓝色的，但是蓝色的比黑色的贵一点。\n本：多少钱？\n售货员：黑色的是2300，蓝色的3200。\n本：那我还是要一辆黑色的吧。黑色的比较帅。",
    "traditional": "黑色比較帥\n\n本：我要買這種電動車，什麼顏色的比較好？\n售貨員：黑的怎麼樣？\n本：我不太喜歡黑色。藍色的有嗎？\n售貨員：有藍色的，但是藍色的比黑色的貴一點。\n本：多少錢？\n售貨員：黑色的是2300，藍色的3200。\n本：那我還是要一輛黑色的吧。黑色的比較帥。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Black is Cooler"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：我要买这种电动车，什么颜色的比较好？",
      "traditional": "本：我要買這種電動車，什麼顏色的比較好？",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ yào mǎi zhè zhǒng diàn dòng chē shén me yán sè de bǐ jiào hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I want to buy this electric scooter, which color is better?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "售货员：黑的怎么样？",
      "traditional": "售貨員：黑的怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán hēi de zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Salesperson: How about black?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：我不太喜欢黑色。蓝色的有吗？",
      "traditional": "本：我不太喜歡黑色。藍色的有嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ bú tài xǐ huan hēi sè lán sè de yǒu ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I don’t really like black. Do you have it in blue?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "售货员：有蓝色的，但是蓝色的比黑色的贵一点。",
      "traditional": "售貨員：有藍色的，但是藍色的比黑色的貴一點。",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán yǒu lán sè de dàn shì lán sè de bǐ hēi sè de guì yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Salesperson: Yes, we have it in blue. But the blue one is a bit more expensive than the black."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：多少钱？",
      "traditional": "本：多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "běn duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: How much?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "售货员：黑色的是2300，蓝色的3200。",
      "traditional": "售貨員：黑色的是2300，藍色的3200。",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán hēi sè de shì 4 lán sè de 4",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Salesperson: The black one is 2300, the blue one is 3200."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：那我还是要一辆黑色的吧。黑色的比较帅。",
      "traditional": "本：那我還是要一輛黑色的吧。黑色的比較帥。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ hái shi yào yí liàng hēi sè de ba hēi sè de bǐ jiào shuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then I’d better take the black one. Black is cooler."
    }
  ],
